MERADGEN 1.0: Monte Carlo generator for simulation of radiative
events in parity conserving doubly-polarized Moller scattering

Authors I. Afanasev, E. Chudakov, A. Ilyichev and V. Zykunov

Version 23/05/2006


run.f      -- the sample of generation
test.f     -- the tests v, t1 and z simulation
meradgen.f -- main program
fsir.f     -- the cross section of real photon emission calculation
rnd.dat    -- random number

For simulation of radiative events run

make

and

./meradgen.exe

For test simulation in test.f choose the interested value for itest
(see test.f for detail) run

make test

and

./test.exe
